otags": [], "format": null, "name": "Welcoming Vampire", "source": "owned", "strategy": "PRIMARY STRATEGY: Voltron / Equipment (Boros)\n\nGAME PLAN: Deploy Rograkh turn 1 (0-mana with first strike, menace, trample), then pile Equipment on him. Ardenn bypasses equip costs entirely by freely attaching Equipment at beginning of combat. Race to 21 commander damage.\n\nKEY LINES:\n\u2022 Turn 1 Rograkh \u2192 Turn 2+ deploy Equipment \u2192 Ardenn attaches for free\n\u2022 First strike + menace + trample = hard to block, first to deal damage\n\u2022 Sword cycle and power-boosting Equipment for fast commander kills\n\u2022 Artifact recursion recovers destroyed Equipment\n\u2022 Protection effects keep Rograkh alive through removal\n\nWANTS:\n\u2022 Equipment (especially with power boosts)\n\u2022 Equipment cost reduction or free attach effects\n\u2022 Protection for commander (hexproof, indestructible, ward)\n\u2022 Double strike / additional combat steps\n\u2022 First strike / menace / trample synergy\n\u2022 Artifact recursion\n\nDOES NOT WANT:\n\u2022 Cards that don't directly advance the voltron kill\n\u2022 Expensive creatures that compete for Equipment\n", "unresolved": [], "uuid": "a1bb025ec3c5414b9eb202e6e921ef32"}